Project: Anemia Severity Among Reproductive-Age Women
Course: MSBD 566
Student: Kelsi Dial
Assignment: Midterm Project Submission

This repository contains the midpoint progress for the MSBD 566 course project.
At this stage, the project includes data acquisition, cleaning, exploratory data
analysis, and a proposed modeling plan.

Contents:
- midterm_report.pdf: Written summary of project progress to date.
- notebooks/preliminary_EDA.ipynb: Initial data cleaning and exploratory analysis.
- data/: NHANES demographic and laboratory data files used in the project.

Further modeling and evaluation will be completed in the final project.
